flowchart LR
    subgraph Sources
        SMB[SMB Share]
        SP[SharePoint]
        Git[Git Repos]
        Local[Local Drives]
    end

    subgraph Ingestion
        Sync[Sync Engine]
        Parser[Parser: marker]
        Chunker[Chunker: 512t, 10% ovl]
        Embed[Embedder: embed]
    end

    subgraph Index [Qdrant Engine]
        direction TB
        VS[Dense Vector Store]
        KS[Sparse/Keyword Index]
        ACL[ACL/Metadata Store]
    end

    subgraph Query
        User[User]
        QE[Query Engine]
        IDP[Identity Provider: AD/LDAP]
        Ret[Retriever]
        Rank[Re-ranker: BGE]
        Gen[Generator: qwen3.6-35b-a3b]
    end

    SMB & SP & Git & Local --> Sync
    Sync --> Parser
    Parser --> Chunker
    Chunker --> Embed
    
    Embed --> VS
    Chunker --> KS
    Chunker --> ACL
    
    User --> QE
    QE <--> IDP
    QE --> Ret
    Ret -->|Query + Principal Filter| VS & KS & ACL
    VS & KS & ACL --> Ret
    Ret --> Rank
    Rank --> Gen
    Gen --> QE
    QE --> User